<title>USA: Viacom names Antioco Blockbuster CEO.</title>
<headline>Viacom names Antioco Blockbuster CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viacom Inc said Tuesday that it has named John Antioco chairman and chief executive officer of its Blockbuster Entertainment unit.</p>
<p>Antioco joins Blockbuster from Taco Bell Corp, where he was president and chief executive officer.  Taco Bell is a division of PepsiCo.  </p>
<p>Antioco replaces Bill Fields, who resigned in April.</p>
